close_reason: "The 2026.8.7 lifecycle preserves the multi-agent extension merge fence and passes npm, Bun, and installed-pm acceptance"
body: "TDD sequence: preserve the reproduced failing lifecycle evidence; add direct unit tests for command resolution and installation dispatch; convert the prepare entrypoint to erasable TypeScript; update the pm dependency and fail-closed source inventory; verify npm ci, Bun, the full release gate, and a fresh packed-project installed-pm workflow."
